LineComment   "// A nominal type over a builtin base derives the base's methods; its own impl"
Newline       "\n"
LineComment   "// may add an accessor and a static fn, and they live alongside associated"
Newline       "\n"
LineComment   "// constants without colliding (a getter `band` reads value.band, a static fn"
Newline       "\n"
LineComment   "// `full` is called Health.full(), the assoc const Health.Max is read Type.Name)."
Newline       "\n"
